  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for Communications</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centrum f&#xF6;r kommunikation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r insatsen &#xE4;r bla att st&#xE4;rka den kommunikativa kapaciteten p&#xE5; ministerierna och i regeringen i Serbien, informerar allm. om &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsprocessen fr&#xE5;n plan- till marknadsekonomi f&#xF6;r att skapa ett f&#xF6;rtroende bland folket och &#xF6;ka transparensen och minska  korruptionsrisken i &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsperioden. &quot;Fund for an Open Society&quot; - Soros Foundation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has i.a the objectives: to enhance the Gov.&apos;s capacity for external and internal communication, to inform the public of the ongoing transition activities in order to create a sustainable market economy and decreased corruption as a result of more transparancy in the process. The implementing part is the newly established &quot;Center for Reform Communications&quot; and &quot;Fund for an Open Society&quot; (Soros).</narrative>
  </description>
